OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA murky
OL,6,Fevening and night, with extensive
OL,7,Fcloud cover bringing intermittent
OL,8,Flight rain and drizzle. Becoming a
OL,9,Flittle drier towards dawn, however low
OL,10,Fcloud will remain. Chilly by dawn,
OL,11,Fwith a chance of pockets of grass
OL,12,Ffrost in prone spots.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FLargely cloudy, however
OL,15,Fintermittent light rain should slowly
OL,16,Fdie away, perhaps allowing some
OL,17,Flimited bright or sunny spells into
OL,18,Fthe afternoon. Winds staying light,
OL,19,Fwith near-average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
