OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fbut dry after early fog Monday.
OL,7,FTuesday initially similar but, giving
OL,8,Fway to breezier conditions and
OL,9,Feventual rain from the southwest,
OL,10,Fleaving Wednesday unsettled. Near-
OL,11,Fnormal temperatures.
